st an early match and then withdrew from his final pool match and was eliminated."] "\n\n" [:p {} "In the semis, Reza Dabir defeated American " [:a {:href "/athletes/102411"} "Terry Brands"] ", considered a formidable opponent. This advanced him to the final against Ukrainian " [:a {:href "/athletes/95109"} "Yevhen Buslovych"] ", who was pretty much unknown. It was a comfortable victory for Reza Dabir, winning 3-0, as Brands won the bronze medal over Uzbeki " [:a {:href "/athletes/60817"} "Damir Zakhartdinov"] "."] "\n"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Number"] [:th {} "Competitor"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {:data-toggle "tooltip", :data-placement "right", :data-original-title "Classification Points", :class "footnote"} "CP"] [:th {:data-toggle "tooltip", :data-placement "right", :data-original-title "Technical Points", :class "footnote"} "TP"] [:th {}] [:th {}] [:th {}]]] [:tbody {} [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "1"] [:td {:class "bib"} "1"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/95122"} "Ali Reza Dabir"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/IRI"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/IRI.png"}] "IRI"]] [:td {} "–"] [:td {} "–"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Gold"} "Gold"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "2"] [:td {:class "bib"} "20"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/95109"} "Yevhen Buslovych"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/UKR"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/UKR.png"}] "UKR"]] [:td {} "–"] [:td {} "–"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Silver"} "Silver"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "3"] [:td {:class "bib"} "12"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/102411"} "Terry Brands"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/USA"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/USA